Package: fldesktop
Architecture: all
Depends: fldesktop-wm (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-shell (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-term (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-files (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-edit (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-calc (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-taskmgr (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-view (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-settings (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-mixer (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-network (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-polkit-agent (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-osk (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-charmap (>= ${source:Version}),
         fldesktop-notifyd (>= ${source:Version}),
         xdg-desktop-portal-fl (>= ${source:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fldesktop-greeter, adwaita-icon-theme, fonts-dejavu-core,
            fldesktop-printers, fldesktop-bluetooth, fldesktop-packages,
            fldesktop-flatpak, fldesktop-firewall
Description: lightweight Wayland desktop built with FLTK (metapackage)
 fldesktop is a small desktop environment for Wayland made with the FLTK
 toolkit: its own wlroots compositor, a taskbar panel, an application
 launcher, wallpaper and desktop icons, a greetd greeter, a settings
 center, system tools and a set of core applications.
 .
 This metapackage installs the whole desktop.

Package: fldesktop-wm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fldesktop-shell, xdg-utils
Suggests: grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, swaylock
Description: fldesktop Wayland compositor
 fl-wm is a stacking Wayland compositor based on wlroots with server side
 decorations, keyboard shortcuts, window snapping and the protocols used by
 the fldesktop panel (wlr-foreign-toplevel-management, layer-shell).

Package: fldesktop-shell
Architecture: any
Depends: fldesktop-wm (= ${binary:Version}), xdg-user-dirs, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: dbus-user-session, pipewire, wireplumber, network-manager,
            fldesktop-polkit-agent, fldesktop-notifyd, xdg-desktop-portal-fl,
            bluez, cups
Description: fldesktop panel, launcher and desktop
 The fldesktop session: fl-panel (taskbar, clock, network, volume, battery,
 Bluetooth, printing, notifications, on-screen keyboard button and power
 menu), fl-launcher (searchable
 application menu), fl-desktop (wallpaper and desktop icons), XDG
 autostart support and the wayland-sessions entry.

Package: fldesktop-greeter
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, greetd, cage
Description: FLTK greeter for greetd
 fl-greet is a graphical login screen for the greetd login manager. It runs
 inside the cage kiosk compositor and offers user and session selection,
 power buttons and a built-in on-screen keyboard.

Package: fldesktop-term
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: fldesktop terminal emulator
 fl-term is a terminal emulator built with FLTK and libvterm, with
 scrollback, 256 and true colour support, mouse reporting and bracketed paste.

Package: fldesktop-calc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: fldesktop calculator
 fl-calc is a basic and scientific calculator with history and memory.

Package: fldesktop-taskmgr
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: pkexec
Description: fldesktop task manager
 fl-taskmgr lists running processes with their CPU and memory use and can
 end, kill, stop, continue and re-prioritise them. Its performance view
 graphs CPU, memory, network and disk use.

Package: fldesktop-view
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: fldesktop image viewer
 fl-view shows PNG, JPEG, GIF (animated), BMP, SVG and other images with
 zoom, rotation, slideshow and folder navigation.

Package: fldesktop-files
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, shared-mime-info
Recommends: xdg-utils
Description: fldesktop file manager
 fl-files is a file manager with icon and list views, thumbnails, the XDG
 trash, background copy and move, drag and drop and "open with".

Package: fldesktop-edit
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: fldesktop text editor
 fl-edit is a tabbed text and code editor with syntax highlighting,
 find and replace, auto-indent and line numbers.

Package: fldesktop-settings
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fldesktop-wm, xkb-data, fldesktop-polkit-agent
Suggests: fldesktop-mixer, fldesktop-network, fldesktop-printers, fldesktop-bluetooth,
          fldesktop-packages, fldesktop-firewall, fldesktop-notifyd
Description: fldesktop settings center
 fl-settings collects the desktop settings in one window: appearance,
 panel and desktop, notifications, language and region, default
 applications, keyboard layouts, shortcuts, mouse and touchpad, displays,
 sound, printers, Bluetooth, network, firewall, date and time, software
 updates and system information. Settings tools of other programs are
 listed as well.

Package: fldesktop-osk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fldesktop-wm
Description: fldesktop on-screen keyboard
 fl-osk is an on-screen keyboard for touch screens. It types into the
 focused window through the Wayland virtual-keyboard protocol and offers
 US, German and French layouts plus a symbols page.

Package: fldesktop-charmap
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: unicode-data
Description: fldesktop character map
 fl-charmap browses the Unicode characters by block in any installed font,
 searches them by name or code point and copies them to the clipboard.

Package: fldesktop-mixer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: pipewire, wireplumber
Description: fldesktop volume mixer for PipeWire
 fl-mixer sets the volume of applications, output and input devices,
 chooses the default devices and ports and selects sound card profiles.

Package: fldesktop-polkit-agent
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: polkitd
Provides: polkit-1-auth-agent
Description: fldesktop polkit authentication agent
 fl-polkit-agent asks for the administrator password when a program needs
 polkit authorization in an fldesktop session.

Package: fldesktop-network
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: network-manager, fldesktop-polkit-agent
Description: fldesktop network settings for NetworkManager
 fl-network shows wired and Wi-Fi devices, connects to wireless networks
 and edits saved NetworkManager connections (IPv4/IPv6, DNS, Wi-Fi
 security).

Package: fldesktop-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP key of the fldesktop package repository
 The key that signs the fldesktop apt repository at
 https://yjlion.github.io/fldesktop/debian, installed as
 /usr/share/keyrings/fldesktop-archive-keyring.asc for use with signed-by.

Package: fldesktop-notifyd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: notification-daemon
Recommends: fldesktop-wm
Description: fldesktop notification server
 fl-notifyd shows desktop notifications (org.freedesktop.Notifications):
 icons and images, action buttons, urgency and timeouts. The panel keeps
 a history of them and switches "do not disturb".

Package: xdg-desktop-portal-fl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xdg-desktop-portal
Recommends: grim, slurp, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: xdg-desktop-portal backend for fldesktop
 Implements the file chooser, "open with" dialog, settings (color scheme,
 accent color, fonts), screenshot and color picker, access and account
 dialogs, notification and wallpaper portals for fldesktop sessions, so
 that Flatpak and other portal aware programs use fldesktop dialogs.

Package: fldesktop-printers
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: cups
Description: fldesktop printer settings
 fl-printers adds printers (driverless IPP Everywhere or with a driver),
 changes their settings and defaults, prints test pages and shows and
 cancels print jobs.

Package: fldesktop-bluetooth
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: bluez
Description: fldesktop Bluetooth settings
 fl-bluetooth turns Bluetooth on and off and pairs, connects, trusts and
 forgets devices through BlueZ.

Package: fldesktop-packages
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, packagekit
Description: fldesktop software updates and package manager
 fl-packages installs updates (with their changelogs and security
 advisories), searches, installs and removes packages, enables software
 sources and shows the history, through PackageKit. At login it checks for
 updates and announces them with a notification.

Package: fldesktop-flatpak
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, flatpak
Description: fldesktop Flatpak app store
 fl-flatpak finds, installs, updates and removes Flatpak apps from Flathub
 and other sources, installs .flatpakref files and edits the permissions
 of installed apps.

Package: fldesktop-firewall
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: firewalld
Description: fldesktop firewall settings
 fl-firewall configures firewalld: default zone, panic mode, and per zone
 services, ports, interfaces, sources, masquerading and port forwarding.
